    <fields>
        <fullName>Core_Hot_Issue_Qts_1__c</fullName>
        <description>Succinctly describe the issue (no more than two sentences) and impact to Intel and/or customer (no more than a single sentence).  Note that with the addition of the other fields below, the Executive Summary should be relatively static, just giving a description of the problem.  Status updates, recent results, etc. should go in the other fields, below.</description>
        <inlineHelpText>Succinctly describe the issue and impact to Intel and/or customer.Note that with the addition of the other fields below,this should be relatively static, description of the problem.  Status updates, recent results, etc. should go in the other fields,below</inlineHelpText>
        <label>Executive Summary</label>
        <required>false</required>
        <trackFeedHistory>false</trackFeedHistory>
        <trackHistory>false</trackHistory>
        <trackTrending>false</trackTrending>
        <type>TextArea</type>
    </fields>
    <fields>
        <fullName>Core_Hot_Issue_Qts_6__c</fullName>
        <description>If you have an HSD related to your IPS issue, please include the URL of that HSD in this field.  Last week, we told you to put it in the Executive Summary field, but in the past week, this new field was created just for this purpose.  Thus, please take the HSD URL out of the Executive Summary if it was there from last week, and move it here.  If you have more than one HSD that applies to your IPS issue:  Please only list the most relevant and up-to-date one.  HSD issues can be linked among themselves, so if you have multiple related HSDs for one IPS issue, make sure they are linked to each other within HSD and then put just one HSD into your IPS issue.  If you don’t have an HSD for your IPS issue:  Consider whether you need one.  Again, there is further guidance from DCPAE management forthcoming, but until that arrives, use your best judgment or discuss with management whether it is appropriate to file an HSD for your issue.</description>
        <inlineHelpText>If you have an HSD related to your IPS issue, please include the URL of that HSD in this field.</inlineHelpText>
        <label>HSD URL ?</label>
        <required>false</required>
        <trackFeedHistory>false</trackFeedHistory>
        <trackHistory>false</trackHistory>
        <trackTrending>false</trackTrending>
        <type>Url</type>
    </fields>
